3.1 The total contract price for the goods and services described herein shall be **SGD 285,000.00** (Singapore Dollars Two Hundred and Eighty-Five Thousand), subject to the terms of this Clause 3.

3.2 Payment shall be made by the Company to the Vendor as follows:

(a) **Mobilisation Deposit:** 30% of the total contract price (SGD 85,500.00) payable upon execution of this Contract;
(b) **Second Payment:** 40% of the total contract price (SGD 114,000.00) payable on or before 31 October 2025, upon confirmation of equipment loading and readiness for dispatch;
(c) **Final Payment:** The balance of 30% of the total contract price (SGD 85,500.00) payable within thirty (30) days of the successful completion of the Festival and the satisfactory dismantling and removal of all equipment from the venue.

3.3 All payments shall be made by telegraphic transfer to the Vendor's designated bank account as notified in writing to the Company. Any bank charges shall be borne by the party initiating the transfer.

3.4 The Vendor shall issue a valid tax invoice for each payment installment. Invoices shall be submitted to the Company's accounts department at accounts@festivalworks.sg.

3.5 Late payment by the Company shall incur interest at a rate of 1.5% per month on the outstanding amount, calculated from the due date until the date of actual payment.

**4. DELIVERY AND INSTALLATION SCHEDULE**

4.1 The Vendor shall deliver all equipment to the Festival site at the Marina Bay Floating Platform on or before **25 November 2025 at 08:00 hours**.

4.2 Installation and system tuning shall be completed by **27 November 2025 at 18:00 hours** to allow for scheduled technical rehearsals.

4.3 The detailed schedule for delivery, installation, rehearsals, performances, and dismantling is set out in Annex B.
